The '''Bat Firework''' is a {{Rare}} Miscellaneous Item that launches a firework that explodes into several [[Bat Piñata]]s, which drop {{Item|Green Candy}}. It is only usable in the {{zone|Village}}. 

Each '''Bat Firework''' spawns a random number of bats, ranging from eight to twelve bats.  In order to launch it, you have to have it in your hand and hit the floor or a wall with it.

== Obtaining ==
A '''Bat Firework''' can be bought from the {{NPCSprite|Fear Mongerer}} for {{Item|Green Candy|amount=100}}.

== Purple Candy ==
The player who launches a '''Bat Firework''' receives between {{Green|5}} and {{Green|64}} {{Item|Purple Candy}}.<!-- The average number of candies is 11.11.-->
